    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whimsical and lively garden somewhere in the distant future gets invaded by color-slurping aliens and ends up completely desaturated. The garden robot is on a mission to cleanse the aliens of their gluttony and restore the color palette.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><i>Palette Cleanser is a sweet, compact 3D platformer lovingly crafted by students from Breda University of Applied Sciences over the course of eight months.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/ebf6152ff2d73338324fd8bee3ab1a20.avif?t=1750665933\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly dash and jump around the level controlling an adorable robot, cleansing critters along the way to keep your speed up and your spirits high!\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.poster.avif?t=1750665933\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.webm?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.mp4?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/12d6fee6af766c06732238a038614c84.avif?t=1750665933\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cheeky little aliens think they've taken over, but not for long! Collect them and bring them to safety of their own silliness.\u00a0 But watch out, some might fight back...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.poster.avif?t=1750665933\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.webm?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.mp4?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/8595df5f07de7a096004268eb371fb73.avif?t=1750665933\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a playful twist on size as a tiny robot exploring a HUGE garden! Wander in an open-ended environment and watch the world around you spring back to color as you progress!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.poster.avif?t=1750665933\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.webm?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.mp4?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anything else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, the development team couldn't figure out if the player is: slurp &amp; sliding, dash &amp; riding, zip &amp; zapping, jump &amp; pumping, boot &amp; scooting, hop &amp; bopping, surf &amp; turfing, smooch &amp; smacking, blink &amp; skipping, boom &amp; zooming, Plink &amp; Plonk\u2122-ing, but in any case you go very fast, so how about you just go and figure out and tell us later in the reviews.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/b8e7890c03316002497b99fbab65ee1c.avif?t=1750665933\" width=285 height=228 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whimsical and lively garden somewhere in the distant future gets invaded by color-slurping aliens and ends up completely desaturated. The garden robot is on a mission to cleanse the aliens of their gluttony and restore the color palette.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><i>Palette Cleanser is a sweet, compact 3D platformer lovingly crafted by students from Breda University of Applied Sciences over the course of eight months.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/ebf6152ff2d73338324fd8bee3ab1a20.avif?t=1750665933\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly dash and jump around the level controlling an adorable robot, cleansing critters along the way to keep your speed up and your spirits high!\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.poster.avif?t=1750665933\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.webm?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.mp4?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/12d6fee6af766c06732238a038614c84.avif?t=1750665933\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cheeky little aliens think they've taken over, but not for long! Collect them and bring them to safety of their own silliness.\u00a0 But watch out, some might fight back...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.poster.avif?t=1750665933\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.webm?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.mp4?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/8595df5f07de7a096004268eb371fb73.avif?t=1750665933\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a playful twist on size as a tiny robot exploring a HUGE garden! Wander in an open-ended environment and watch the world around you spring back to color as you progress!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.poster.avif?t=1750665933\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.webm?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.mp4?t=1750665933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anything else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, the development team couldn't figure out if the player is: slurp &amp; sliding, dash &amp; riding, zip &amp; zapping, jump &amp; pumping, boot &amp; scooting, hop &amp; bopping, surf &amp; turfing, smooch &amp; smacking, blink &amp; skipping, boom &amp; zooming, Plink &amp; Plonk\u2122-ing, but in any case you go very fast, so how about you just go and figure out and tell us later in the reviews.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/b8e7890c03316002497b99fbab65ee1c.avif?t=1750665933\" width=285 height=228 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Jump, dash and slide through a futuristic garden in Palette Cleanser, cute 3D platformer focused on smooth movement and an optimistic vibe! Control a tiny robot trying to restore the color palette of its garden. Capture the alien invaders to activate paint sprinklers and make the garden alive again.",
